<view class="page" style="{{n}}"><view class="top-bar" style="{{'padding-top:' + b}}"><text class="back-text" bindtap="{{a}}">‹ 返回</text><text class="top-title">校园饭堂</text><text class="top-placeholder"></text></view><view wx:if="{{c}}" class="hero-card" style="{{h}}"><text class="hero-title">选择今天去哪个饭堂吃饭？</text><text class="hero-desc">{{d}} · {{e}}</text><text class="hero-tip">如果你选了饭堂，AI 只会在你选择的饭堂里为你推荐菜品，最多可选 3 个。</text><text class="section-title section-title--inside">饭堂列表</text><text class="section-desc">每个学校对应一套独立饭堂数据，可单选，也可以多选最多 3 个</text><view wx:if="{{f}}" class="canteen-list"><view wx:for="{{g}}" wx:for-item="canteen" wx:key="f" class="canteen-card" style="{{canteen.g}}" bindtap="{{canteen.h}}"><view class="canteen-card__head"><view><text class="canteen-name" style="{{canteen.b}}">{{canteen.a}}</text><text class="canteen-remark" style="{{canteen.d}}">{{canteen.c}}</text></view><text wx:if="{{canteen.e}}" class="canteen-badge">已选</text></view></view></view><view wx:else class="empty-card"><text class="empty-title">当前学校还没有配置饭堂数据</text><text class="empty-desc">后面接入后端后，这里会按学校动态返回饭堂列表。</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{i}}" class="action-row"><button class="clear-button" style="{{j}}" bindtap="{{k}}">清除选择</button><button class="save-button" style="{{l}}" bindtap="{{m}}">保存选择</button></view></view>